ind":"announcement","title":"Snot Pop! launches 2 November – Play the free demo during Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Snot Pop! is in Steam Next Fest! Hello snot fans! 👋 The sewers officially open on 2 November 2026. The free demo is out now and ready to play during Steam Next Fest. Let's get popping! Blow snot bubbles, trap the Mouldlings, pop them for combos and see how far you get. In the full game:50 hand-tuned levels, then Free Play for as long as you lastSteam Leaderboards: all-time scores, fastest victories and a time trial for every level, on Easy, Normal and HardWeekly boards that reset every Monday, p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691401","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4916720-1846018067938592","game_id":"steam-4916720","kind":"announcement","title":"Snot Pop! on Steam Deck","summary":"Greetings snot lords! 👋 I just wanted to share that I've played Snot Pop! through on my own Steam Deck, and it plays great: Controller support out of the box – no setup or community layouts neededRuns at full speed at the Deck's native resolutionThe game is, correctly, portrait - so it sits centred on the screen with a choice of arcade screen frames either side; all text is sharp and readableSteam Cloud carries your progress, achievements and best times between your Steam Deck, Windows PC and Ma","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T14:25:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938592","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4916720-1842846814447192","game_id":"steam-4916720","kind":"announcement","title":"Snot Pop! Free Demo availa